{"server":"cn","storyId":"act31side_level_act31side_04_beg","groupId":"act31side","stageId":"act31side_04","title":"话桑麻","storyCode":"HS-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"89d4b0a69681a2e2c0ab1b804e5ad0c8ff0c0bd3f26401be0b6cef737cddfc9e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini01_villagevacancy"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你人没事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢大侠，多谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难得从北方买了些珍贵矿石，想卖到南方去，没想到在这碰上拦路的劫匪。要不是遇上大侠您，我这一趟生意可就血本无归了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是商队，就别挑小路走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是急着赶路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，还得多谢您仗义出手，一点点心意，请笑纳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没兴趣，走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生请留步！留步......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看先生的身手可真是了不得——您是武林中人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要和我比划比划？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岂敢岂敢......您看到了，我就是个手无缚羽之力的商人，哪有和您比试的能耐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过既然是武林中人......实在是巧，不久前我碰巧搜罗来一本珍贵的武学秘籍，先生说不定会感兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笑话，这世上有我用得上的武学秘籍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别急嘛，先生要不先看一眼？在下做生意向来只卖客人用得上的商品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是看一眼吧，不会耽误您几分钟时间，保证不让您后悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有完没——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到，阁下的武艺竟然精进到如此地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今我已经不是阁下对手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赢了你，我是不是就是天下第一？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经是天下第一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天下第一......我是天下第一？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"心头血热，拳锋上还留有余温。\n登高临绝顶，毕生夙愿已然了却——\n不，不对！\n这人是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini01_villagevacancy"},{"type":"narration","text":"一阵恍惚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底是什么人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚说了，一介商贩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么都卖，什么都收。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他是如何找到我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你习武四十年，就是为了打败一个对手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼前就有一个少花几十年功夫就能追上那个人的机会，先生想不想要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用不着你来插手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生不打算买我的东西，但先生却有一件我打算买的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说先生不久前得到了一把宝剑，想问问您，愿意用什么价格卖给我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活见鬼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来先生对我的出价不太满意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"价钱还可以商量，何必这么急躁呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没得商量！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很重视这把剑，你也很重视这次约定，我没有看错我的结义兄弟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四十年，只求武学上的登峰造极，令人佩服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了这个目标，你真的能不惜一切代价？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别装神弄鬼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥？","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是了。我相信世上没有做不成的交易，只有谈不拢的价格。无妨，我再加价就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，你女儿的命，怎么样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g4_factory_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂，工业重地，非请莫入哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见啊，年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么大的阵仗，都是你设计的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禁止无事献殷勤，有事说事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难得见一面，这么不欢迎我啊，真寒心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就没想过，要不是我辛辛苦苦走南闯北做生意，年年分文不差地纳税，你造这个大玩意的钱从哪来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少来，你的钱又是从哪里来的？还不是靠投机倒把赚差价，卖的东西还不是你自己造的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说真的......在早些时候，你们做买卖的人不太受待见是有原因的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你干嘛跑我这来？我以为你会先去找黍姐的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好奇，这个说是能让我们一家人安稳活下去的东西有多神奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说你建这个东西也不太顺利，不用找人搭把手吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要找人帮忙也不找你啊，工程的问题，你又不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黍在帮的忙，我大概也能帮上一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你又在打什么主意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道这个核心能源，不只是一个工程，要让它成为能支持我们活下去的概念上的“巨兽”，也得赋予它概念上的“生命”才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以才需要姐姐她的能力，但她一个人在这里要操劳的事有那么多，未免也太辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的本领我多少也学到了一点，让我代劳不是更有效率？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你还挺关心她的......我还以为你们是闹掰了来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，你是答应了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，打住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从哪来回哪去，今天我就当没见过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我的姐姐妹妹，都不太愿意见我啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是害怕你那算盘珠子，总觉得和你说两句话都会上当被骗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前每次和你见面，你从我这骗走的东西还少了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是帮你把一些东西卖出去，得来的好处可从来没少你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停停停，没工夫听你花言巧语的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是赶快回去，最好离我的工程远一点，我可不想再被那几个老头子念叨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果，我真的想进去看看呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么紧张嘛，搞得我好像真的会抢自己妹妹的东西一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是来看看自己的妹妹，见你们还这样活蹦乱跳的，我也就放心了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g3_fieldpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见过一次后就找不到踪迹了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他上哪去了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"（咬）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......夕？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，上次见你不还挺神气的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们代理人，不该这么肆无忌惮地使用能力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别嚷嚷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是情况特殊，我也不愿意主动见司岁台的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他果然已经找过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们在谋划什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十二楼五城动工之际，他突然回到大荒城，是有什么打算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你问我？你不是秉烛人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然会查清......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算从哪里查起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怀疑之前的灾害，背后另有原因......十二楼五城的工程近在眼前，那个罪人很有可能在附近落子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个落单的秉烛人，没有其他人的支援又能做到多少事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台在大荒城的人力也不止我一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就可以像原来一样，什么都不清楚，安安心心地跟在别人后头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脱掉了那身官服，眼神看上去倒明白点了......还不算冥顽不灵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轮不到你来指点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜欢和满脑子算盘的人打交道，这些话我只说一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个绣花的精明到顶，做事从不会露出马脚，你们司岁台跟在他身后这么多年，他的能耐你们当然有数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对付这种家伙......直接动手反而比较有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接动手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一卷画？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凭你一个，就算发现他做什么坏事，又能怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用这个东西，好歹能困住他一会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"秉烛人私自接触代理人是重罪，更不用说借用代理人的能力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就看你怎么选了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你愿意帮我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话说得够多了，好自为之吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g3_fieldpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......多谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g3_fieldpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你刚才就是想来这边玩，结果发现我在河边睡着了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对啊，要是梦的话为什么我身上还有梦里摘的花？我的腿也很痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梦里腿抽筋，说明你要长个子了。恭喜恭喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，你这几年可是一点个子都没有长，只有嗓门每年都在变大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我发现了，你其实是逃学出来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘嘘嘘，嚷嚷什么，嚷嚷什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！你果然是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的是天师府的学生吗？怎么总是见你在外面跑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不上学，那当然是有比上学更重要的事要干，不用你操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答应帮你保密逃学的事，你也不要说我又跑来河边了，行不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的扇子呢？还我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，小气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都送你这个笛子了，还想怎样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是你随手用竹子做出来的嘛，还是你自己吹过了才送我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随手？！你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己听听这音色，看看这材质，我自己都没舍得用几次，送给你我还肉疼了好久，你不要就还我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真有这么珍贵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧好吧，我把扇子还你。但我们两个约好了，要互相保密啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还差不多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，就是这株水稻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了吧，它红得特别漂亮，这一片都倒了，就它还活着，它是什么新品种吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎！你怎么直接就把它给拔了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我交作业用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道哪里还有这种水稻吗？别的作物也行，就是这种看起来漂亮得不像话的，你别告诉别人，偷偷把我叫过来，我摘一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样能行吗？你这是作弊吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，你别自己摘了拿来给我啊，我怕你摘坏了，一定让我过来摘，也别告诉其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧行吧，你要是被天师们抓了，别供出我就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是好好掂量一下，上次喂错饲料害得实验品种牧兽拉肚子的事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g1_desertedcityfield_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是谁......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个面目模糊的老农站在田地中，髻上戴着几朵小小的花。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锄头？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过来锄地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把这片地锄松，把种子种进去，让种子长出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要用心锄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少年接过锄头，老农转过身去，弯下腰，继续在土地上耕作起来。\n手上的锄头沉甸甸，他把它高高举起。\n砸落在土地上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咚！\n一株禾苗从刚锄松的土地里长了出来，随即开始抽条，顶上长出细嫩的穗，开出几朵小花。\n少年感到一阵没来由的疲惫，他擦了擦额头上渗出的汗，再次挥起锄头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咚！\n稻花从盛放到凋落不过一瞬，穗子在眨眼间饱满起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老人家，这稻种长起来了，还结了穗，应该马上就能收了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少年觉得锄头愈发沉重起来，他看向自己的手，手上长出几个厚茧，纵横的褶皱爬上他的双手和胳膊。\n老农没有回话，只是默默地耕耘着脚下的一方土地。\n小苗刚刚从土壤中探出头，低矮地长在刚长起来的一片水稻下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咚！\n方生方死，几粒金黄的稻种从枝头滚落，随即大片大片的植株枯死在土地上。\n少年的动作停在刚刚挥下锄头的那一瞬，他愕然地看着眼前的景象。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老人家......？这稻谷怎么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳咳......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"春去秋来，一季一收。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小伙子，对你来说，什么是一季呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结出果实算是吗？吃饱肚子算是吗？让种子再次种下去算是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少年高高举起锄头，一下，又一下地锄向地面。\n稻种在他的脚下生根发芽，开花结穗，凋落成泥，种子们从未有机会被他捧在手中。\n他感受到力气的流逝，发丝在他头上疯长，从乌黑坚韧逐渐变得脆弱柔软，身上的衣服碎裂成片，挂在他逐渐弯下去的脊背上。\n在一次力竭的挥锄后，一缕花白的长发垂在他的脸边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我用尽自己的一生在这里培植作物，可我的一生太短暂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几百，几千，几万，这些数字对我来说，太庞大了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我老了......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"脚下一片狼藉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看不到它们长成，我没有时间能等到它们结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对于我的生命来说，这是一项不可能完成的事情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老农在河堤上栽下一棵树，伸手抚摸着树干，随即消散在空气中。\n一棵又一棵树出现在了河堤上，树上系着红绸，红绸上挂着木牌，木牌上的字迹模糊，禾生有些看不清。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"风吹过，树林发出簌簌声响。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些木牌都是什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么地里长出来的庄稼都留不住？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"稻谷的碎粒安静地躺在地上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻人，你看到了什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......我看不到结果......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他再次举起锄头，一下落地，一下枯竭，一下衰老。\n他把自己的生命传向土地，再由土地去滋养植株，可植株没有任何回应，植株生长，植株枯萎，植株没有留下种子。\n他的苍白长发如同枯草，盖在他身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"做这些事真的有意义吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少年佝偻着背，感受着苍老带来的痛苦蔓延上他的脊背，虚弱夺走了他开口的力气，他只能嗫嚅着，发出一些意义不明的声音。\n他浑浊的目光看向地面，土地上伏倒着一片又一片的稻苗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老农？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有谁能......看到那一天呢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"禾生回过头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个白色的身影站在他的身后，飘扬在身后的长发苍苍如古木，深蓝如河流。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那人挥了挥衣袖，稻苗疯长，郁郁葱葱。\n直到遮住禾生全部视线。\n那人迈开步子，恍惚间，四周陷入一片死寂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——？————！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小禾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g8_crestofweir"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾？小禾！醒醒！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
